Is a Handwritten Promissory Note Valid?
In many jurisdictions, a handwritten Promissory Note signed by both parties may be enforceable, but a typed and professionally formatted version is usually stronger and clearer.

________________________________________

Does a Promissory Note Need Witnesses or Notarization?
Depending on location and loan type, notarization or witnesses may be recommended for stronger legal validity.

